WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.190
<b>Kirio Drugstore</b>

00:00:01.570 --> 00:00:06.190
Mr. Reiji, Ms. Noela. Lunch is ready.

00:00:06.780 --> 00:00:08.400
Help yourselves.

00:00:08.670 --> 00:00:09.800
Let's eat.

00:00:09.800 --> 00:00:10.860
Let's eat!

00:00:10.860 --> 00:00:13.180
Yeah, let's eat!

00:00:14.780 --> 00:00:16.240
Hey, Paula.

00:00:16.240 --> 00:00:18.520
You come here during mealtimes 
on purpose, don't you?

00:00:18.520 --> 00:00:22.070
Do I? Mina, this bread is friggin' delicious.

00:00:22.070 --> 00:00:24.720
Don't be so crude. We're eating.

00:00:25.150 --> 00:00:26.910
It's seriously delicious!

00:00:28.330 --> 00:00:30.920
So how's business been since then?

00:00:30.920 --> 00:00:32.320
Slow.

00:00:32.320 --> 00:00:33.420
Figures.

00:00:33.420 --> 00:00:36.340
Then you can come eat with us anytime.

00:00:36.340 --> 00:00:38.520
Woof. Paula, eat with us.

00:00:38.520 --> 00:00:43.110
Wow! In that case, I won't 
hesitate to come back tomorrow,

00:00:43.110 --> 00:00:47.640
the day after that, and every day 
after that until the end of time!

00:00:50.090 --> 00:00:54.570
Listen up. We're a pharmacy, 
not a restaurant.

00:00:55.430 --> 00:00:57.580
Master, I have arrived!

00:00:57.580 --> 00:00:59.160
I'm here, too.

00:00:59.500 --> 00:01:03.760
Ah, Mr. Ejil and Ms. Vivi.
We were just having lunch.

00:01:03.760 --> 00:01:05.000
Why don't you join us?

00:01:05.000 --> 00:01:07.660
Gosh, what a coincidence.

00:01:07.660 --> 00:01:12.510
Yeah, what a total coincidence that 
you're in the middle of lunch.

00:01:14.600 --> 00:01:17.260
<i>These two definitely showed 
up now on purpose, too.</i>

00:01:17.260 --> 00:01:18.830
It's so good!

00:01:19.750 --> 00:01:22.520
<i>At least Ejil and Vivi 
only show up occasionally,</i>

00:01:22.520 --> 00:01:26.210
<i>but it seems like Paula actually comes 
to eat for free on purpose every day.</i>

00:01:26.210 --> 00:01:28.080
Mina! More, please!

00:01:28.600 --> 00:01:31.070
<i>Or so I thought...</i>

00:01:38.260 --> 00:01:42.310
<b>Drugstore</b>

00:01:38.260 --> 00:01:42.310
<b>In Another World</b>

00:03:03.470 --> 00:03:09.470
<b>Today's Prescription: Part 1
 Pass, No Fail</b>

00:03:04.660 --> 00:03:07.840
Ms. Paula hasn't been coming lately.

00:03:08.330 --> 00:03:11.360
We haven't seen her in about a week.

00:03:11.360 --> 00:03:15.700
That's right. I've even been 
making enough food for her, too.

00:03:15.700 --> 00:03:18.230
Woof! I'll eat the leftovers!

00:03:18.230 --> 00:03:20.560
You'll upset your stomach 
again if you eat too much.

00:03:21.200 --> 00:03:22.360
Woof...

00:03:22.360 --> 00:03:26.510
Mr. Reiji, doesn't Ms. Paula live alone?

00:03:27.030 --> 00:03:31.260
Yeah, I'm worried about her since 
she suddenly stopped coming.

00:03:31.260 --> 00:03:33.700
I'm worried, too.

00:03:33.700 --> 00:03:36.130
I'll go stop by her shop later.

00:03:36.130 --> 00:03:39.660
Thank you. Please do.

00:03:40.780 --> 00:03:43.280
Paula, are you in here?

00:03:46.130 --> 00:03:48.210
You should've said something 
if you were here.

00:03:48.210 --> 00:03:51.700
Unlike you, I'm a busy person.

00:03:51.700 --> 00:03:54.170
Hey, don't treat me like 
some kind of idle bum.

00:03:54.790 --> 00:03:56.170
So what do you want?

00:03:56.170 --> 00:03:59.920
I just wanted to check in and 
make sure you're still alive...

00:03:59.920 --> 00:04:02.420
What's this? Are you, by any chance, studying?

00:04:02.420 --> 00:04:04.960
Not "by any chance." 
That's exactly what I'm doing.

00:04:04.960 --> 00:04:06.860
Can't you tell?

00:04:06.860 --> 00:04:08.150
What are you studying?

00:04:08.630 --> 00:04:13.390
Once every two years, I have to take a test 
to renew my item identification license.

00:04:13.610 --> 00:04:16.360
Renew your item identification license?

00:04:16.980 --> 00:04:21.890
<i>Huh. That must be like the secondhand 
shop license in my old world.</i>

00:04:21.890 --> 00:04:26.460
Since shops holding this license are 
officially recognized by the kingdom,

00:04:26.460 --> 00:04:29.730
customers can do business 
with them with peace of mind.

00:04:29.730 --> 00:04:33.580
Trust comes first in my line of work.

00:04:34.440 --> 00:04:38.060
You kind of look more intellectual 
than usual, Paula.

00:04:38.060 --> 00:04:43.310
What? Really? Studying all this 
material is exhausting, though.

00:04:49.930 --> 00:04:53.850
You're here, Rei? Why didn't 
you say something sooner?

00:04:54.290 --> 00:04:58.230
Did you think everything that had 
happened until now was your imagination?

00:04:59.110 --> 00:05:00.320
What?!

00:05:00.560 --> 00:05:04.070
C'mon, Rei, please.

00:05:04.070 --> 00:05:08.470
Forget about the dungeon. Make me 
a medicine so I won't fail this test.

00:05:08.470 --> 00:05:10.870
One that'll guarantee I don't friggin' fail.

00:05:10.870 --> 00:05:12.130
Hey, let go of me.

00:05:12.130 --> 00:05:13.540
Please, Rei!

00:05:13.540 --> 00:05:18.070
If I fail this test, 
I'll have to close up shop!

00:05:18.070 --> 00:05:22.660
That license is a lifeline for tool shops.

00:05:22.660 --> 00:05:25.420
Make me a medicine, Rei!

00:05:25.420 --> 00:05:27.410
Make you a medicine?

00:05:27.410 --> 00:05:29.550
It takes days for me to make things.

00:05:29.550 --> 00:05:31.890
When's your test, anyway?

00:05:31.890 --> 00:05:33.310
Tomorrow.

00:05:35.310 --> 00:05:37.430
I'm friggin' screwed!

00:05:37.430 --> 00:05:43.320
I have to score 85/100, but I scored 
only 20/100 on a practice test just now!

00:05:43.320 --> 00:05:44.580
O-Only20?

00:05:44.580 --> 00:05:48.110
Actually, I exaggerated. 
I really scored 10/100.

00:05:48.490 --> 00:05:51.530
Both 20 and 10 are failing marks!

00:05:51.530 --> 00:05:53.540
What have you been doing until today?

00:05:53.540 --> 00:05:55.450
Studying, obviously!

00:05:55.450 --> 00:05:57.160
And this is what that got you?

00:05:59.260 --> 00:06:00.930
You're so mean, Rei.

00:06:02.490 --> 00:06:05.510
So where are you taking the test tomorrow?

00:06:05.510 --> 00:06:06.610
In the next town over.

00:06:06.610 --> 00:06:09.980
I figured I'd get there in time if 
I left first thing tomorrow morning,

00:06:09.980 --> 00:06:12.540
so I'm studying as hard as 
I can until the last minute,

00:06:12.540 --> 00:06:14.600
but the test covers so much material.

00:06:16.370 --> 00:06:18.720
Rei, please.

00:06:18.720 --> 00:06:21.060
Yeah, but...

00:06:21.060 --> 00:06:26.030
Please! Make me a medicine 
so I won't fail, Rei!

00:06:28.220 --> 00:06:31.990
Well, maybe it's not impossible.

00:06:31.990 --> 00:06:35.160
What? What is it? Did you 
come up with an idea?

00:06:35.810 --> 00:06:39.460
<i>Well, I do have an idea for a recipe.</i>

00:06:40.470 --> 00:06:44.800
Listen, Paula. I'm going 
to go make a new medicine.

00:06:44.800 --> 00:06:47.880
It'll be a race against the clock 
until it's time for the test.

00:06:48.850 --> 00:06:50.840
Rei, I love you!

00:06:51.350 --> 00:06:53.970
I'll go make it right away, 
so stay here and study.

00:06:53.970 --> 00:06:57.140
Okay! I'll do my best, Rei!

00:06:59.600 --> 00:07:03.540
Mr. Reiji, welcome back. How was Ms. Pau—

00:07:05.350 --> 00:07:07.860
Okay, I've got all the ingredients.

00:07:08.790 --> 00:07:09.930
Mr. Reiji?

00:07:09.930 --> 00:07:12.130
Master, why are you in a hurry?

00:07:12.130 --> 00:07:13.100
Oh, you know.

00:07:13.100 --> 00:07:16.910
Hey, if you guys are free, could you help me?

00:07:17.140 --> 00:07:18.280
Of course.

00:07:18.280 --> 00:07:19.870
Woof! You can count on me!

00:07:39.430 --> 00:07:46.900
<b>Prayer For Success</b>

00:07:39.850 --> 00:07:40.940
It's done.

00:07:40.790 --> 00:07:46.900
<b>Pass, No Fail</b>

00:07:41.480 --> 00:07:42.740
<i>Pass, No Fail.</i>

00:07:42.740 --> 00:07:46.900
<i>A medicine that prevents one from forgetting 
what they learned for 24 hours.</i>

00:07:47.210 --> 00:07:51.110
Noela, could you take this 
medicine to Paula immediately?

00:07:51.110 --> 00:07:54.070
Woof!

00:07:52.210 --> 00:07:54.070
See you later.

00:07:54.380 --> 00:07:56.530
Woof!

00:08:02.830 --> 00:08:05.200
I've finally been released 
from my imprisonment.

00:08:05.200 --> 00:08:10.330
It would seem that Lord Ejil has been going 
out periodically without my knowledge.

00:08:11.340 --> 00:08:13.430
Where has he been going?

00:08:13.430 --> 00:08:14.300
Woof!

00:08:16.350 --> 00:08:17.970
My posters of Lord Ejil!

00:08:21.370 --> 00:08:22.740
Woof!

00:08:22.740 --> 00:08:23.940
Why now?

00:08:24.980 --> 00:08:27.900
24-hour Pass, No Fail?

00:08:27.900 --> 00:08:33.240
Yeah, Paula has an exam to renew her 
item identification license tomorrow.

00:08:33.530 --> 00:08:36.870
So you helped her using 
the power of medicine.

00:08:36.870 --> 00:08:38.780
Impressive as always, Mr. Reiji.

00:08:38.780 --> 00:08:41.570
But there's no guarantee that she'll pass.

00:08:41.570 --> 00:08:44.040
It'll come down to how hard Paula can study.

00:08:44.610 --> 00:08:47.830
Woof. Master, mission complete.

00:08:47.830 --> 00:08:49.260
Good work.

00:08:49.260 --> 00:08:51.800
So how was Paula?

00:08:51.800 --> 00:08:55.210
Serious. She said, "Thank you."

00:08:55.210 --> 00:08:59.300
I see. It's a little soon 
to be thanking me, though.

00:08:59.300 --> 00:09:01.490
I'm sure she'll be fine.

00:09:01.490 --> 00:09:04.600
Let's all pray for Ms. Paula's success.

00:09:07.400 --> 00:09:09.520
<i>All that medicine does is</i>

00:09:09.520 --> 00:09:12.940
<i>prevent someone from forgetting 
what they learned for 24 hours.</i>

00:09:13.410 --> 00:09:15.820
<i>They still have to learn it once.</i>

00:09:16.510 --> 00:09:19.040
<i>Will Paula be able to learn 
everything she needs to know?</i>

00:09:23.040 --> 00:09:27.500
<b>Kirio Drugstore</b>

00:09:23.750 --> 00:09:27.500
<b>Several Days Later</b>

00:09:24.340 --> 00:09:27.500
I wonder what happened 
to Ms. Paula after that.

00:09:27.870 --> 00:09:31.760
Yeah. The results of her exam should 
already have been announced.

00:09:31.760 --> 00:09:32.560
Woof!

00:09:33.090 --> 00:09:34.220
She's here!

00:09:35.730 --> 00:09:38.010
Rei, look at this!

00:09:38.010 --> 00:09:39.400
Oh, Paula.

00:09:40.130 --> 00:09:42.600
What do you think of this?

00:09:45.390 --> 00:09:48.170
Hey, you got your license renewed.

00:09:48.170 --> 00:09:49.530
Congratulations.

00:09:49.530 --> 00:09:51.360
Congrats, congrats!

00:09:51.360 --> 00:09:54.530
All thanks to you and that medicine!

00:09:54.770 --> 00:09:58.240
No, ultimately, you're the one 
who did the hard work, Paula.

00:09:59.320 --> 00:10:03.370
You think so? Anyway, that 
stuff is friggin' crazy!

00:10:03.760 --> 00:10:05.410
I'm counting on your help next time, too.

00:10:05.410 --> 00:10:07.040
Don't get ahead of yourself.

00:10:08.860 --> 00:10:12.040
But seriously, I haven't slept a wink.

00:10:12.040 --> 00:10:13.590
I crammed like crazy.

00:10:13.590 --> 00:10:16.510
I know, Ms. Paula. Have you eaten yet?

00:10:16.510 --> 00:10:18.300
You're welcome to join us.

00:10:18.530 --> 00:10:22.750
I knew I could count on you, 
Mina. That's why I came.

00:10:22.750 --> 00:10:26.520
It's not like renewing my license has 
brought more customers to my store.

00:10:26.520 --> 00:10:27.780
Of course it hasn't.

00:10:27.780 --> 00:10:29.750
But first...

00:10:35.000 --> 00:10:36.190
This is to thank you.

00:10:38.950 --> 00:10:42.270
Woof! No kissing Master!

00:10:42.270 --> 00:10:44.900
Aw, that's too bad.

00:10:44.900 --> 00:10:47.620
What? Were you trying to kiss me?

00:10:49.000 --> 00:10:51.610
Another time, if the opportunity 
presents itself.

00:10:51.610 --> 00:10:54.210
Anyway, let's eat!

00:10:54.510 --> 00:10:55.390
Huh?

00:10:55.390 --> 00:10:57.100
Woof...

00:10:58.420 --> 00:11:01.150
Master, I've come to help!

00:11:01.150 --> 00:11:03.600
I'm here for my part-time job, too.

00:11:04.430 --> 00:11:06.850
You've arrived just as we 
were having lunch again.

00:11:06.850 --> 00:11:08.430
You're welcome to join us.

00:11:08.430 --> 00:11:12.020
Really? I guess I'll have to, then!

00:11:12.020 --> 00:11:14.670
Yes, gladly.

00:11:13.400 --> 00:11:15.230
<i>These kids...</i>

00:11:15.230 --> 00:11:18.640
<i>Is the shop going to turn back 
into a restaurant for a while?</i>

00:11:21.970 --> 00:11:24.120
<i>Well, nothing wrong with that.</i>

00:11:28.650 --> 00:11:32.980
Gel, gel. Sweetheart Cooling Gel.

00:11:32.960 --> 00:11:35.540
<b>Today's Prescription: Part 2
 Sun Sun Go Away Sunscreen Gel</b>

00:11:32.980 --> 00:11:36.150
Cooling, cooling gel.

00:11:36.150 --> 00:11:40.220
Thanks to the gel, I stay cool.

00:11:46.920 --> 00:11:49.930
What? You think my skin is perfect?

00:11:50.260 --> 00:11:54.860
Yeah, I wish I had clear, 
beautiful skin like yours.

00:11:55.200 --> 00:11:59.920
Uh, it seems like you've all 
forgotten, but Mina is a ghost.

00:11:59.920 --> 00:12:02.150
Of course her skin is clear.

00:12:07.370 --> 00:12:10.330
Ms. Noela's so fluffy 
when she's sleeping, too.

00:12:10.330 --> 00:12:16.330
I want to touch her. I want to touch her, 
but Master said I can't cross this line.

00:12:18.850 --> 00:12:21.340
This is torture!

00:12:22.730 --> 00:12:26.950
In other words, Vivi needs a 
medicine that blocks UV rays.

00:12:26.950 --> 00:12:29.010
Please, Reiji.

00:12:29.530 --> 00:12:32.820
As you can see, we don't 
have any customers today.

00:12:32.820 --> 00:12:34.720
Why don't you try making something?

00:12:34.720 --> 00:12:38.580
I wished for something similar 
while I was still alive.

00:12:39.260 --> 00:12:40.030
You, too?

00:12:40.300 --> 00:12:45.690
Yes. I'm not the only one. UV rays 
are the arch-nemesis of all women.

00:12:45.690 --> 00:12:50.830
They age your skin and cause 
wrinkles, spots, and sagging.

00:12:50.830 --> 00:12:53.660
That doesn't sound good for men, either.

00:12:53.960 --> 00:12:57.750
So if you were to succeed, 
I'm certain the product would be a hit!

00:12:57.750 --> 00:13:00.530
Our food expenses are higher 
lately for some odd reason,

00:13:00.530 --> 00:13:02.340
so it would offset that, too.

00:13:02.620 --> 00:13:05.210
What? Have we been spending 
that much on food?

00:13:05.210 --> 00:13:08.010
In any case, Mr. Reiji, please!

00:13:08.780 --> 00:13:11.410
Okay, I get it. I'll give it a shot.

00:13:12.140 --> 00:13:13.430
All right!

00:13:15.120 --> 00:13:17.020
These ingredients should do.

00:13:17.020 --> 00:13:20.900
Oh, right. I bet people would prefer 
something that smells nice, too.

00:13:23.290 --> 00:13:25.780
Mr. Reiji, have some of these.

00:13:25.780 --> 00:13:29.490
We received more expensive 
sweets from Lady Flam.

00:13:29.490 --> 00:13:31.260
Oh, thanks.

00:13:31.260 --> 00:13:36.580
Work hard. I'm sure your new 
medicine will be a big hit.

00:13:36.930 --> 00:13:38.590
I'll leave these here.

00:13:38.590 --> 00:13:42.340
<i>Mina's really looking 
forward to this medicine.</i>

00:13:42.340 --> 00:13:44.300
<i>Are we really spending that much on food?</i>

00:13:44.950 --> 00:13:47.510
<i>It's definitely their fault.</i>

00:13:50.140 --> 00:13:51.010
All right.

00:14:01.380 --> 00:14:02.390
It's done.

00:14:02.090 --> 00:14:12.990
<b>Sun Sun Go Away 
Sunscreen Gel</b>

00:14:02.700 --> 00:14:05.690
<i>Sun Sun Go Away Sunscreen Gel.</i>

00:14:05.690 --> 00:14:08.390
<i>A gel that blocks UV rays.</i>

00:14:08.390 --> 00:14:12.030
<i>Allows one to maintain clear, beautiful skin.</i>

00:14:14.260 --> 00:14:16.240
Hey, it's done...

00:14:16.570 --> 00:14:18.620
Did you finish, Mr. Reiji?

00:14:16.820 --> 00:14:18.620
Is it done, Reiji?

00:14:18.620 --> 00:14:22.260
Now, now. Calm down, ladies.

00:14:23.580 --> 00:14:27.710
In addition to UV ray protection, 
I paid attention to moisturizing,

00:14:27.710 --> 00:14:31.050
feel, and even smell while 
making this medicine.

00:14:34.060 --> 00:14:37.980
Smells good. Who wants to try it first?

00:14:39.440 --> 00:14:42.270
What? You're that desperate to try it?

00:14:42.620 --> 00:14:43.750
Yes!

00:14:44.230 --> 00:14:49.190
I-I see. If your eyes are going to gleam 
with that much childlike excitement,

00:14:49.190 --> 00:14:50.820
then I guess it was worth making.

00:14:52.570 --> 00:14:53.900
This is it?

00:14:53.900 --> 00:14:58.730
Listen up. Put a little bit on your finger 
and spread it over areas prone to sunburn.

00:14:58.730 --> 00:15:00.280
As you will it!

00:15:00.280 --> 00:15:01.830
Yes, sir!

00:15:01.830 --> 00:15:03.920
Why are we suddenly in a historical drama?

00:15:05.320 --> 00:15:07.630
It's nice and cool.

00:15:08.020 --> 00:15:12.840
Yes. Somehow my skin feels more supple.

00:15:14.320 --> 00:15:16.390
You two look like you're enjoying yourselves.

00:15:19.190 --> 00:15:20.120
Pardon me!

00:15:20.120 --> 00:15:21.570
Pardon me!

00:15:21.570 --> 00:15:23.650
Seriously, why the historical drama speak?

00:15:30.470 --> 00:15:32.070
Ms. Noela...

00:15:32.610 --> 00:15:38.290
Oh, wow! I'm totally fine, Reiji!

00:15:38.290 --> 00:15:39.970
The sunlight isn't bothering me.

00:15:39.970 --> 00:15:44.040
Seriously. Even though I'm a ghost, I feel 
like I'm being protected from the sun.

00:15:44.300 --> 00:15:45.870
That's good to hear.

00:15:46.240 --> 00:15:49.880
Hooray! Hooray! Yahoo!

00:15:50.430 --> 00:15:52.840
If you combine this with the cooling gel,

00:15:52.840 --> 00:15:55.350
you should be able to go anywhere, 
even during the summer.

00:15:55.350 --> 00:15:58.130
I'm glad. I'm so happy.

00:15:58.130 --> 00:16:01.730
Reiji, thank you. Yahoo!

00:16:01.730 --> 00:16:08.400
I'm so glad. I understand what it's 
like to not be able to go outside.

00:16:08.820 --> 00:16:14.600
<i>Oh, right. Mina was trapped inside 
this house for almost a hundred years.</i>

00:16:17.390 --> 00:16:19.830
Master, what happened to Vivi?

00:16:21.160 --> 00:16:24.490
I made her a sunblock that's 
also good for the skin.

00:16:24.490 --> 00:16:26.560
Apparently, it put her in high spirits.

00:16:27.040 --> 00:16:28.390
I want to use it, too.

00:16:28.390 --> 00:16:29.860
What? You, too?

00:16:29.860 --> 00:16:30.650
Woof.

00:16:30.650 --> 00:16:31.670
Okay, I guess.

00:16:36.830 --> 00:16:41.160
I'm surprised Ms. Noela is expressing 
an interest in a beauty product.

00:16:41.160 --> 00:16:43.600
You think so, too?

00:16:43.600 --> 00:16:44.700
Yes.

00:16:44.700 --> 00:16:49.410
I thought Noela was only interested in food.

00:16:49.410 --> 00:16:52.400
Ms. Noela has probably reached that age, too.

00:16:52.400 --> 00:16:54.030
Reiji!

00:16:55.960 --> 00:16:59.870
Try touching my cheek. My skin is so springy.

00:16:59.870 --> 00:17:01.620
Uh, okay...

00:17:02.710 --> 00:17:03.540
Boing.

00:17:03.850 --> 00:17:06.250
I-It's so springy!

00:17:06.570 --> 00:17:09.150
Try touching it even more.

00:17:09.150 --> 00:17:10.640
What? But...

00:17:10.640 --> 00:17:13.270
Mr. Reiji, go ahead and touch her.

00:17:13.270 --> 00:17:17.700
It's also a pharmacist's job to 
confirm the effects of his medicine.

00:17:17.700 --> 00:17:19.970
Okay, yeah. In that case...

00:17:19.970 --> 00:17:21.590
Here you go.

00:17:22.800 --> 00:17:23.560
Boing.

00:17:25.210 --> 00:17:26.560
<i>It feels kind of nice.</i>

00:17:26.930 --> 00:17:31.270
<i>This isn't good. I might 
get hooked on this feeling.</i>

00:17:31.720 --> 00:17:35.650
Boing, boing, boing.

00:17:39.870 --> 00:17:42.030
Master, me, too.

00:17:42.930 --> 00:17:44.580
Noela, you used too much!

00:17:44.580 --> 00:17:46.250
Master, touch.

00:17:46.250 --> 00:17:47.210
But...

00:17:47.740 --> 00:17:48.640
Woof.

00:17:49.450 --> 00:17:50.130
Woof.

00:17:50.130 --> 00:17:51.880
Okay, then...

00:17:53.270 --> 00:17:55.220
Boing.

00:17:55.970 --> 00:17:58.090
Master, what do you think?

00:18:00.550 --> 00:18:04.600
Boing, boing, boing, boing.

00:18:04.600 --> 00:18:06.600
Master, what do you think?

00:18:06.600 --> 00:18:09.400
Uh, yeah. It's nice, I guess.

00:18:09.970 --> 00:18:15.080
<i>Honestly, all the gel Noela applied 
made her cheek even more squishy,</i>

00:18:15.080 --> 00:18:18.310
<i>springy, and soft. It feels amazing to touch!</i>

00:18:18.310 --> 00:18:22.870
<i>This is seriously bad news. It might 
even be better than fluffy Noela!</i>

00:18:23.280 --> 00:18:24.870
Boing. Woof.

00:18:25.380 --> 00:18:27.970
I see. I understand.

00:18:30.240 --> 00:18:32.340
What's wrong, Mr. Ejil?

00:18:35.960 --> 00:18:44.100
P-Please allow me to poke your 
cheek as well, Ms. Noela!

00:18:44.560 --> 00:18:45.910
Master!

00:18:45.910 --> 00:18:48.370
Hey, part-timer! Go in your crate!

00:18:48.860 --> 00:18:49.890
Good!

00:18:53.110 --> 00:18:56.570
Lord Ejil hasn't returned today, either.

00:18:56.960 --> 00:19:01.390
If I'd known this would happen, I would've 
given him all the potions he wanted.

00:19:01.970 --> 00:19:04.900
Lord Ejil, where are you?

00:19:06.540 --> 00:19:09.000
<b>Kirio Drugstore</b>

00:19:07.220 --> 00:19:09.000
<b>The Next Day</b>

00:19:12.020 --> 00:19:17.590
Because of that medicine, Ms. Vivi can go 
outside with peace of mind from now on.

00:19:17.910 --> 00:19:18.830
Yeah.

00:19:20.340 --> 00:19:22.880
Woof. Master, touch.

00:19:22.880 --> 00:19:24.960
Did you use that medicine again?

00:19:24.960 --> 00:19:26.010
Woof, woof.

00:19:27.740 --> 00:19:29.480
O-Okay, then...

00:19:30.150 --> 00:19:32.100
Boing, boing.

00:19:30.570 --> 00:19:32.440
Yup, still springy.

00:19:33.400 --> 00:19:34.540
Woof!

00:19:36.190 --> 00:19:38.180
What's gotten into Noela?

00:19:38.800 --> 00:19:40.060
I knew it.

00:19:40.060 --> 00:19:41.260
You knew what?

00:19:41.260 --> 00:19:45.890
Well, you know Ms. Noela and 
Ms. Vivi are very good friends.

00:19:45.890 --> 00:19:46.620
Yeah.

00:19:46.620 --> 00:19:51.110
Ms. Noela didn't enjoy you giving 
Ms. Vivi all your attention,

00:19:51.110 --> 00:19:53.830
especially since they're friends.

00:19:53.830 --> 00:19:55.190
That's why she's using the gel?

00:19:55.190 --> 00:19:58.970
Yes, Ms. Noela was probably jealous.

00:19:59.300 --> 00:20:00.920
I-I see.

00:20:01.730 --> 00:20:07.800
<i>I'm acting like it all makes sense to me, 
but I had no idea how she felt.</i>

00:20:07.800 --> 00:20:10.390
<i>There is one thing I learned, though.</i>

00:20:12.310 --> 00:20:16.070
Mr. Reiji, I heard you 
developed a new medicine that

00:20:16.070 --> 00:20:19.650
makes your skin springy and  
even prevents sunburns.

00:20:19.650 --> 00:20:22.360
Could I get some for myself and my mother?

00:20:22.360 --> 00:20:25.070
What? You already know about the gel?

00:20:25.070 --> 00:20:25.970
Hey.

00:20:26.410 --> 00:20:27.360
We meet again.

00:20:27.360 --> 00:20:28.910
Mr. Kururu.

00:20:29.180 --> 00:20:33.250
Could I get some of your new medicine, too?

00:20:33.250 --> 00:20:35.590
And some for my sister, as well.

00:20:35.590 --> 00:20:38.570
Please keep your face away from mine.

00:20:38.570 --> 00:20:41.340
Rei, I heard the news.

00:20:41.340 --> 00:20:44.410
Give me some of your new medicine 
that makes your skin beautiful.

00:20:44.410 --> 00:20:45.730
Who told you?!

00:20:45.730 --> 00:20:50.410
Pharmacist, could I, um... get some of 
that medicine everyone's talking about?

00:20:50.410 --> 00:20:51.350
That rumor spread fast!

00:20:52.720 --> 00:20:54.780
Looks like you'll be able to sell a lot of it.

00:20:55.570 --> 00:20:56.810
Looks that way.

00:20:58.030 --> 00:21:00.020
<i>As Mina said,</i>

00:21:00.870 --> 00:21:04.410
<i>the sunblock's sales exploded,</i>

00:21:04.750 --> 00:21:07.750
<i>and the profits went toward 
our food expenses that had</i>

00:21:07.750 --> 00:21:09.070
<i>recently increased like crazy.</i>

00:21:09.070 --> 00:21:10.380
So good.

00:21:11.450 --> 00:21:13.160
<b>Closing Time</b>

00:21:13.610 --> 00:21:14.620
Kirio Drugstore.

00:21:14.870 --> 00:21:15.790
Thank you...

00:21:15.790 --> 00:21:17.750
...for visiting...

00:21:18.060 --> 00:21:20.140
...again today.

00:21:20.140 --> 00:21:21.330
Woof.

00:21:23.680 --> 00:21:26.850
<i>This is the world I used to live in.</i>

00:21:28.550 --> 00:21:33.110
<i>I don't want to go into the office.
 I wish I could skip work.</i>

00:21:33.560 --> 00:21:38.560
<i>Someone free me from full trains, 
superiors who abuse their authority,</i>

00:21:38.560 --> 00:21:40.680
<i>and the sales work I hate so much.</i>

00:21:41.610 --> 00:21:42.820
<i>I hate it.</i>

00:21:43.530 --> 00:21:47.490
<i>I hate this life!</i>

00:22:01.810 --> 00:22:03.630
Where am I?

00:22:02.520 --> 00:22:04.920
<b>Next Customer</b>

00:23:34.970 --> 00:23:40.250
<b>Illustration by: Atori</b>
